                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7fe5ab1b-9cb7-3ce0-972d-5fd62438d084",
                        "entry_id": "d96aed1d-eb8e-386a-b03f-d826da96e1b5",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to become spoiled"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0d3c452a-064c-4c0b-85a0-47652b2bc14f",
                                "sense_id": "7fe5ab1b-9cb7-3ce0-972d-5fd62438d084",
                                "text": "— Как э́то мо́жно! — вступи́лась жена́, — приглаша́ть на тако́й стол, как наш! Ведь вы же не студе́нты: Бори́с Па́влович в Петербу́рге избалова́лся, я ду́маю…",
                                "translation": "“What are you thinking!” his wife protested. “Inviting people to our poor table! I mean, you’re no longer students. Boris Pavlovich has been spoiled in St Petersburg, I would imagine…”",
                                "english": "“What are you thinking!” his wife protested. “Inviting people to our poor table! I mean, you’re no longer students. Boris Pavlovich has been spoiled in St Petersburg, I would imagine…”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
